flowchart LR
  UI[Angular standalone components] -->|HTTP via LotolabApiService| WEB[REST input adapters]
  WEB --> IN[Contest input ports]
  IN --> CAPP[ContestApplicationService]
  CAPP --> COUT[Contest output ports]
  COUT --> JDBC[JdbcTemplate adapter]
  JDBC --> PG[(PostgreSQL / Flyway V1–V9)]
  CAPP --> DOMAIN[Shared framework-free domain records]
  CAPP --> HOOK[ContestResearchTrigger output port]
  HOOK --> TRIGGER[ContestResearchTriggerAdapter]
  TRIGGER --> MINING[research.MinePatternsUseCase]
  WEB --> MINING
  CRON[research.PatternMinerAgent] --> MINING
  MINING --> RESEARCH_APP[RunPatternMiningService]
  RESEARCH_APP --> RESEARCH_DOMAIN[PatternMiningAlgorithm walk-forward-2]
  RESEARCH_APP --> RESEARCH_PORTS[Research output ports]
  RESEARCH_PORTS --> RESEARCH_TX[Spring TransactionTemplate + JDBC]
  RESEARCH_TX --> PG
  RESEARCH_APP --> RESEARCH_EVENT[Spring completion event]
  RESEARCH_EVENT --> INTERPRET[AgentInterpretationService BEFORE_COMMIT]
  INTERPRET --> JOBS
  WEB -. Other feature APIs .-> APP[Legacy application services]
  APP --> PORTS[Shared application.port interfaces]
  PORTS --> JDBC
  APP --> LOG[Infrastructure LogContext in some services]
  JDBC --> EVENTS[Spring ApplicationEventPublisher]
  EVENTS --> LEARN[Transactional listeners in application]
  APP --> JOBS[Durable agent/ML jobs]
  JOBS --> GEMINI[Optional Gemini RestClient]
  APP -. ML pipeline separate from optimized generator .-> ML[Logistic training/inference]
